      "name": "comment",
      "x": 39,
      "y": 12.1,
      "text": "The matchNoteOn can be trained to respond to specific keys or drum pads. \n\nToDo:\n* Hit a drum pad or a note on your keyboard to learn one note.\n* Hit a different drum pad or note on your keyboard to for the second module.\n* Play those two notes to trigger the different sounds.\n* Press the \"learn\" button on one of the matchNoteOn modules then learn a different note.\n\nYou can use this to trigger sounds or sequences or anything you want.\n",
